        }
      },
      "skill_passive_list": {
        "A16EULxPG2dENY71": {
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Mana Residue",
          "passive_description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-id=\"P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Trigger</strong></a>&nbsp;the <strong>Mana Gorger</strong> is reduced to 0 HP</p></li></ul><p>If it had <strong>Eaten</strong>, everything it swallowed comes back out at once. The creature that struck it down fully recovers <strong>MP</strong>.</p>",
