      "study_text": "<p>A drifting sac of stolen magic, and the reason apprentices are told to count their reserves twice. It has no interest in hurting anyone — only in <strong>drinking</strong> — and the moment it is full it wants nothing more than to be somewhere else. Spellwork slides off the thing. The mages who deal with them best have mostly given up casting and simply <strong>hit it with the staff</strong>.</p>",
